I'm fond of telling the story about how I once used several blessed
magic markers, bunches of scroll, "save and restore", tons of patience
and Nethack 3.0j+ to work up a +49 Mjollnir.  Amazing weapon, that. 
Looks like things have been changed so that weapons are similar to
armor.  Used to be in 3.0j that weapons always had a 1 out of 3 chance
of surviving beyond +5 for every plus you went up (so reading a blessed
scroll while you were passed the danger point would have a 1 in 27
chance of not destroying your weapon, no matter what the enchantment)
while the chance for armor to be destroyed kept going up for every plus.
 Now it looks like both weapons and armor have this diminishing chance
deal.  Good thing, too.

